{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "あやっほー！\n小川彩です💝"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日は暖かかったですねー☺️ついこの間は雪が降ってたのにね❄︎.*\nみなさんも健康第一で体調には気をつけて過ごしましょうね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな暖かい今日は乃木坂46リズムフェスティバルのイベントでした🎤\n来てくださったみなさんありがとうございました✨️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobVsZPIT.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobrWpyir.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "∞------------------------------∞"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📺乃木坂工事中\nテレビ東京　毎週日曜日"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大新年会2026！楽しかった〜余興はどうでしたか？緊張したけど50TAさんやれて超嬉しかった✊🏻みんなもテレビの前で男子！女子！やってくれてた？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobsGF00c.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このウィッグ毛量が多すぎて最初すごいことになってたんだけど、ヘアメイクさんて本当にすごい🙌🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今夜は6期生強化バトル💪🏻24:25〜です！ぜひご覧ください👀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "《乃木坂配信中》\nhttps://youtube.com/@nogizakahaishinchu"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📻乃木坂46 小川彩のbaby baby maybe\nBAYFM　毎週水曜日24:00〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先週あーやファームの収穫祭をしました🍅\n次回は続き！ミニ大根のサンタシロースをいっただきまーす！😋ぜひお聴きください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ふつおた、みんなのbabyちゃん👼🏻‪‎(＝かわいいもの)エピソード募集してます♪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "テーマ的など番組公式Xに載っていますのでぜひチェックしてください🎧 ⸝⋆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "《radiko》https://radiko.jp/r_seasons/10029305\n《メッセージ》 aya@bayfm.co.jp\n《番組公式Ｘ》https://x.com/aya78MHz"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "💿 2月25日(水)発売　ジブリをうたう その2"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "発売まであと10日となりました！！！\nYouTubeもぜひチェックしてください(◜ᴗ◝ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全曲トレイラー映像\nhttps://youtu.be/UDiD0pPdDSY"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ショートムービー『ジブリをうたう その２ ーふうとなぎの物語ー』\nhttps://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLYl8TUn3GuVEVYDOq-8YknTuancdW_041"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "∞------------------------------∞"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mob8ecOM0.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "✈️𓂃𓈒𓏸︎︎︎︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobJYskyu.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あーやぶろぐ☺︎☺︎☺︎ー(140)"}], "source": "official"}